    "answer": {
      "short": "\\$33 707.57. Taxable income: \\$131 461; fourth tax bracket.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Gross income} &= 106\\,774 + 25\\,022 + 615.19 = \\$132\\,411.19\\\\\\text{Deductions} &= 190 + 330 + 430 = \\$950\\\\\\text{Income less deductions} &= 132\\,411.19 - 950 = \\$131\\,461.19\\\\\\text{Taxable income} &= \\$131\\,461\\end{align*}$$\nRound taxable income down to whole dollars. This is the fourth tax bracket.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Excess} &= 131\\,461 - 120\\,000 = \\$11\\,461\\\\\\text{Tax payable} &= \\text{Base tax} + \\text{Tax rate}\\times\\text{Excess}\\\\\\text{Tax payable} &= 29\\,467 + 0.37\\times11\\,461\\\\\\text{Tax payable} &= \\$33\\,707.57\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
